        {
          "@id": "http://smart.who.int/base/smart-base.jsonld#process/Process_L2ComponentEditReview",
          "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
          "description": "One pass over one L2 DAK component: the agent edits it, runs its checker, renders and stages it with a before/after, and hands it on; review forks off beside that hand-on and never holds it up (owner, 2026-10-14: adjudication is QA, not a gate). Called by each authoring track of l2-dak-authoring.bpmn (Process_L2Dak), one call per component pass.\n\nThe call's inputs, which are the only things that differ between components (skill l2-component-edit-review, \"The inputs, per component\"):\n- component: personas and user scenarios (C2, C3), business processes (C4), core data elements and glossary (C5) with their terminology bindings, decision-support and scheduling logic (C6, C7), indicators and requirements (C8, C9);\n- authoring skill: l2-dak-authoring, bpmn-authoring, dmn-authoring or terminology-management, named on the calling activity, so it joins this process's skills along the call path (review-task.bpmn's scoped composition);\n- renderer and diff: what the reviewer looks at, before and after;\n- checker: the mechanical checks the agent runs before asking anyone;\n- reviewing role: the person who takes on this process's reviewer lane for the call.\n\nOne process rather than one per component because nothing but those inputs differs: DMN's test cases are its checker, BPMN's picture is its renderer, the glossary's term diff (dak-data-dictionary-diff.ts) is its diff and its binding check its checker, and traceability to L1 is the checker of personas, scenarios and requirements.",
          "enforcement": "advisory",
          "flowCount": 13,
          "inSubgraph": "http://smart.who.int/base/smart-base.jsonld#directory/smart-base-house-processes",
          "name": "L2 component edit and review",
          "nodeCount": 13,
          "sourcePath": "processes/content/l2-component-edit-review.bpmn",
          "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/litlfred/smart-base/blob/main/smart-base/processes/content/l2-component-edit-review.bpmn",
          "startNode": "http://smart.who.int/base/smart-base.jsonld#process/Process_L2ComponentEditReview/node/Start_ComponentPass",
          "summary": "One pass over one L2 DAK component: the agent edits it, runs its checker, renders and stages it with a before/after, and hands it on; review forks off beside that hand-on and never holds it up (owner, 2026-10-14: adjudication is QA, not a gate)."
        },
